 "type": "question"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "en advant "}], "type": "incorrect"}, {"contents": {"type": "", "content": "."}, "type": "post_question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_8"}]}], "type": "GIW", "id": 10, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " \nThe meeting comes to a close. \n"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: \n<span class=\"bullet\">Proofread the sentence. </span> \n<span class=\"bullet\">Click on the incorrect word. </span> \n<span class=\"bullet\">Type in the correct word to complete the sentence. </span><span class=\"bullet\">Use capital letters where necessary.</span>"}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"type": "template_override", "content": 2}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}]}], "type": "RSLT", "id": 11, "_data": [{"contents": [], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le04ob06re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le04ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le04ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le04ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I'd like to welcome everyone to the meeting. Thank you, Peter, and the rest of the staff for making it on such short notice.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Let's get down to business, shall we?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Has everyone got a copy of the agenda?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Sorry, I am not sure I am following you.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Did you read the agenda and supporting documentation in advance?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pete</span>r: Oh yes ... yes, I have."}, {"time": "24000", "image": "engenn6le04ob06re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Okay then. The first thing on the agenda is our new potential client \u2013 Holly's. Farmani \u2013 CEO of Holly's - is currently on the lookout for a new PR Agency. I have told him during our meeting that Polygon has expressed an interest in the deal and will be formalizing a proposal. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Excuse me. Could you elaborate on that?"}, {"time": "47000", "image": "engenn6le04ob06re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Basically, we have to submit a proposal with our visions and ideas for their image management and publicity. Do you have any ideas, Peter?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm sorry, could you be more specific?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Of course! Our firm needs to manage the company's communication through  social media \u2013 as well as traditional advertising by staging or sponsoring events to promote their new clothing line. I think that this pretty much brings us to the end of our meeting. Thank you all for your contribution and for attending today."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter's New Job"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Project Begins"}, {"type": "position", "content": 6}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le04ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Language for Managing Meetings"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "The language of meetings is central to business communication. Whether you are holding a meeting or attending one, it is important that you use and understand key language and expressions. "}, {"type": "text", "content": " Opening a meeting properly, setting an agenda and time limits, keeping to the agenda, and closing a meeting are key components of an effective meeting. The chart below illustrates the most important language to help you hold or attend a meeting. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Opening the meeting</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Introducing items on the agenda</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>I'd like to welcome everyone to the meeting.</li> <li>Thank you all for making it at such short notice.\\t</li>\\t <li>Shall we make a start? </li> <li>Let's get down to business. </li> <li>Has everyone got a copy of the agenda?</li>\\t <li>We're here to discuss ... </li> <li>The objective of this meeting is to ... </li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>The first item on the agenda is ... </li> <li>The first thing we need to look at is ...</li> <li>The first thing we need to decide on is ...</li> <li>Now I'd like us to turn to the next point on the agenda. </li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">  Welcoming participation</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">  Closing the meeting</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>Do you have any ideas/suggestions ... ?</li> <li>I'd like to hear your thoughts on this ... </li> <li>What do you think about that ... ?</li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul> <li>I think that this pretty much brings us to the end of our meeting. </li> <li>So, I'd like to run briefly through all the points we've discussed.</li>  <li>Thank you all for your contribution to this meeting. </li> <li>Thank you all for attending today. </li></ul></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Dealing With Communication Breakdowns"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Sometimes you don't understand what was said or something was not clear to you. It is, therefore, important to express your lack of understanding and seek clarification from the person you are talking to. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Expressing lacking of understanding</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">  Asking for clarification</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>Sorry, I am not sure I am following you. </li> <li>I beg your pardon, but I don't quite understand. </li> <li>I'm not sure I know what you mean.</li> <li>I'm not sure I follow you.</li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>Could you elaborate on that? </li> <li>Could you be more specific?</li> <li>Could you repeat that, please? </li> <li>Could you clarify that, please?</li> <li>Do you mean ... ? </li></ul></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "on short notice"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "quickly and not scheduled  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Thank you for making it on short notice. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob06aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear in a meeting."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "supporting documentation"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "written information used to summarize items discussed in a meeting"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have attached the supporting documentation to the report."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob06aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "in advance"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "before something happens or is expected to happen"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Did you read the report in advance?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob06aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "on the lookout for  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "pay attention in order to find something you want"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They are on the lookout for a PR agency."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob06aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to express an interest"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to say that you are interested in something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our agency has expressed an interest in the deal."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob06aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to formalize "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make a plan official, by deciding and clearly describing all the details"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We will have to formalize a proposal soon to send to them."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob06aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "management "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the activity of controlling and organizing the work that a company or organization does"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What ideas do we have for their image management?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob06aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to stage "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to organize a public event"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We can use advertising to stage an event for the client."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob06aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to sponsor "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to give money to an event in exchange for the right to advertise"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We want to sponsor events so we can promote their clothing line. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob06aud10"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "You want to have a meeting with your co-workers about a new project."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Think about what the project is. Jot down a few notes for the agenda for the meeting. What items do you want to talk about? Include 3 - 5 items."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Review your agenda. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Plan for your meeting: <br/>a. How will you open the meeting?<br/>b. How will you introduce the different items on your agenda?<br/>c. How will you welcome participation?<br/> d. How will you close the meeting? "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write your answers down."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice for your meeting aloud. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about a project related to work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write down items on an agenda."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I manage a meeting."}]}]}